{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19621","headline":"戏赠诗 · 李翱","name":"戏赠诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"县君好砖渠，绕水恣行游。\n鄙性乐疎野，凿地便成沟。\n两岸值芳草，中央漾清流。\n所尚既不同，砖凿可自修。\n从他後人见，境趣谁爲幽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19621.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19621","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}